{"id":"reference/Zero-Bit-Types","kind":"langref","title":"零位类型","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Zero-Bit-Types","file":"reference/Zero-Bit-Types.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Zero-Bit-Types","text":"零位类型"},{"depth":3,"slug":"void","text":"void"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Zero-Bit-Types\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zero-Bit-Types/#Zero-Bit-Types\">零位类型</a></h2>\n\n      <p>某些类型的 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#sizeOf\">@sizeOf</a> 为零：</p>\n      <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zero-Bit-Types/#void\">void</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数类型</a> <code><span class=\"tok-type\">u0</span></code>。</li>\n          <li>长度为零，或元素类型为零位类型的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Arrays/#Arrays\">数组</a>和<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Vectors/#Vectors\">向量</a>。</li>\n          <li>只有一个标记的 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/enum/#enum\">enum</a>。</li>\n          <li>所有字段均为零位类型的 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/struct/#struct\">struct</a>。</li>\n          <li>只有一个字段且该字段为零位类型的 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#union\">union</a>。</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>这些类型仅有一个可能值，因此表示它们需要零个位。使用这些类型的代码不会纳入最终生成的代码：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">zero_bit_types.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">export</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">entry</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> = {};\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> y: <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> = {};\n    x = y;\n    y = x;\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>转化为机器码时，<code>entry</code> 的函数体中不生成任何代码，即使在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#debug\">debug</a> 模式下也是如此。例如在 x86_64 上：</p>\n      <pre><code>0000000000000010 &lt;entry&gt;:\n  10:\t55                   \tpush   %rbp\n  11:\t48 89 e5             \tmov    %rsp,%rbp\n  14:\t5d                   \tpop    %rbp\n  15:\tc3                   \tretq   </code></pre>\n      <p>这些汇编指令没有任何与 void 值相关的操作，只执行函数调用的序言与尾声。</p>\n\n      <h3 id=\"void\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zero-Bit-Types/#void\">void</a></h3>\n\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code> 可以用于实例化泛型类型。例如，对于 <code>Map(Key, Value)</code>，可以向 <code>Value</code> 类型传入 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code>，使其成为 <code>Set</code>：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_void_in_hashmap.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expect = std.testing.expect;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"turn HashMap into a set with void\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> map = std.AutoHashMap(<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span>).init(std.testing.allocator);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">defer</span> map.deinit();\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> map.put(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, {});\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> map.put(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, {});\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(map.contains(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(!map.contains(<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>));\n\n    _ = map.remove(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(!map.contains(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_void_in_hashmap.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_void_in_hashmap.test.turn HashMap into a set with void...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>注意，这与为哈希映射的值使用占位值不同。使用 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code> 作为值类型后，哈希映射条目类型不包含值字段，因此映射占用的空间更小。此外，如上所示，所有存储和读取值的代码都会被删除。</p>\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code> 与 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">anyopaque</span></code> 不同。<code><span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code> 的大小已知为零字节，而 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">anyopaque</span></code> 的大小未知但非零。</p>\n      <p>只有 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code> 类型表达式的值可以被忽略。例如，忽略非 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code> 表达式会产生编译错误：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_expression_ignored.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"ignoring expression value\"</span> {\n    foo();\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_expression_ignored.zig</kbd>\n<span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_expression_ignored.zig:2:8: </span><span class=\"sgr-31m\">error: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">value of type 'i32' ignored\n</span>    foo();\n    <span class=\"sgr-32m\">~~~^~\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_expression_ignored.zig:2:8: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">all non-void values must be used\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_expression_ignored.zig:2:8: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">to discard the value, assign it to '_'\n</span>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>但表达式类型为 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code> 时不会报错。可以通过赋值给 <code>_</code> 显式忽略表达式结果。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_void_ignored.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"void is ignored\"</span> {\n    returnsVoid();\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"explicitly ignoring expression value\"</span> {\n    _ = foo();\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">returnsVoid</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_void_ignored.zig</kbd>\n1/2 test_void_ignored.test.void is ignored...OK\n2/2 test_void_ignored.test.explicitly ignoring expression value...OK\nAll 2 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":20,"translated":20}}
